# Bulk without hint: entries another leaf took for this range between the bulk
# load beginning and the leaf's creation lie below its starting read position.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestBulkWithoutHint
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the bulk leaf starts at the WAL head at its creation instead of the head when the bulk load began
PERTURBS: Create

--- FIND
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a1"] = hint - 1]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the head at creation, not the birth hint.
    /\ rp' = [rp EXCEPT !["a1"] = next - 1]
--- END
